---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="bg-black py-24">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-12">
    <!-- Texto e información -->
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-white">
        <span data-i18n="about.title">About</span> 
        <span class="text-lime-500" data-i18n="about.me">Me</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.p1">
        Software Engineer specialized in building fast, scalable web and mobile applications. I combine modern full-stack engineering with a clean UX mindset—designing, developing, and shipping intuitive, production-ready systems from back-end logic to responsive interfaces.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.p2">
        Driven by a continuous learning mindset and high standards of execution, I thrive in collaborative, fast-paced environments. I am looking to join a dynamic team where I can take technical ownership, solve complex product challenges, and contribute to building high-impact software.
      </p>

      <a 
        href="/YojanLoaizaagudelo_CV.pdf" 
        download 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-8 text-lime-500 hover:text-lime-300 transition-colors font-mono text-sm"
      >
        <span data-i18n="about.cv">Download my CV</span> <span>↓</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Contenedor de la Imagen con Sweep Shimmer -->
    <div class="reveal flex justify-center">
      <div class="group relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900/60 p-2 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 hover:border-lime-500/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(132,204,22,0.15)]">
        
        <!-- BANDA DE LUZ SWEEP (Pasa de izquierda a derecha al hacer Hover) -->
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-10 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300">
          <div class="absolute -top-[50%] -bottom-[50%] w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-lime-400/20 to-transparent -rotate-45 -translate-x-[200%] group-hover:translate-x-[350%] transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Esquinas Decorativas Animadas -->
        <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 h-3 w-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-lime-500/60 z-20 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:border-lime-400"></span>
        <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 h-3 w-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-lime-500/60 z-20 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:translate-y-1 group-hover:border-lime-400"></span>

        <!-- Imagen del Perfil -->
        <img
          src="/profile.jpg"
          alt="Yojan Loaiza"
          class="relative z-0 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:-rotate-1 block w-full h-auto object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>